<BaseLayout title="Support | The Royal House of Engagement" description="Support information for Low Value Content orders and product questions.">
  <article class="plain-page"><header><p class="eyebrow">Royal Office of Practical Matters</p><h1>Support, plainly stated.</h1><p>Commercial matters are administered in direct language. Product status, payment, fulfillment, and customer rights shall remain unambiguous.</p></header><div class="rows"><section><h2>Before launch</h2><p>The current storefront contains development issues and one restricted test checkout configuration. General sales and public customer support have not yet opened.</p></section><section><h2>Order status</h2><p>Customers with a valid order token will be able to view payment, production, shipment, and delivery status through the existing order-status service.</p></section><section><h2>Final policies</h2><p>Shipping, return, replacement, sizing, care, and contact information will be published before products become publicly purchasable.</p></section></div></article>
</BaseLayout>
